export function measuresOf(state){let care=0,duty=0;const add=k=>{const m=MORAL[k];if(m){care+=m[0];duty+=m[1];}};for(const e of state.story?.seen??[])add(e.id+'/'+e.choice);for(const r of state.history??[]){for(const p of r.pivots??[])add(p.pivot+'/'+p.choice);const fx=r.from!==undefined&&prioritiesFor(r.from).includes(r.profile?.priority)?priorityFx(r.profile.priority):null;if(fx){care+=fx.care??0;duty+=fx.duty??0;}}return {care,duty};}
